WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.800
With his eighth gym badge on the line,

2
00:00:05.866 --> 00:00:07.866
Ash challenged the Snowbelle Gym.

3
00:00:08.266 --> 00:00:12.033
However, Gym Leader Wulfric dealt him a crushing defeat.

4
00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:17.466
Counting his previous battle with Sawyer, it was Ash's second loss in a row.

5
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.866
And afterward, Ash disappeared into the forest alone.

6
00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:28.433
Huh?

7
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.666
Pika!

8
00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:39.666
Greninja's gone, too?

9
00:00:39.733 --> 00:00:41.000
Mmm.

10
00:00:41.066 --> 00:00:44.433
Its strength is back, so there's really nothing to worry about.

11
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.066
Any idea where it went?

12
00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:49.900
I wanna know where, too.

13
00:00:50.533 --> 00:00:52.733
Maybe Greninja went after Ash.

14
00:01:16.866 --> 00:01:20.633
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

15
00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:24.666
♪ Knock me down, I'll just get up again ♪

16
00:01:24.733 --> 00:01:27.866
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

17
00:01:27.933 --> 00:01:29.766
♪ Pokémon ♪

18
00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:32.233
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

19
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.500
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

20
00:01:35.566 --> 00:01:37.500
♪ Pokémon ♪

21
00:01:37.566 --> 00:01:40.366
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

22
00:01:53.233 --> 00:01:56.233
I want-- I need to pull it together.

23
00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.100
I've got no choice.

24
00:01:59.533 --> 00:02:00.666
I have to.

25
00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:09.533
About Ash, he'll be back, right?

26
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.533
No need to worry, Bonnie.

27
00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:13.466
Pi? Pika.

28
00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.500
Pi. Pika. Pika!

29
00:02:24.933 --> 00:02:27.100
Pika, Pika! Pika, Pi!

30
00:02:27.933 --> 00:02:29.100
Pika.

31
00:02:29.666 --> 00:02:30.666
Hawlucha.

32
00:02:32.533 --> 00:02:34.666
Pikachu.

33
00:02:38.966 --> 00:02:40.433
-Huh?

34
00:02:40.766 --> 00:02:41.833
Hm. Huh?

35
00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:44.366
Hey, where's Serena?

36
00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.233
What's up with the twerp?

37
00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.333
Maybe he's sick.

38
00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.933
Staring into space?

39
00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.100
Don't look at me.

40
00:02:59.166 --> 00:03:01.500
Hey, this just might work out for us.

41
00:03:01.566 --> 00:03:03.633
Huh? Pikachu time.

42
00:03:03.933 --> 00:03:05.333
Go and catch it.

43
00:03:23.366 --> 00:03:24.400
Ash!

44
00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:36.466
I'm sorry. I shouldn't have just left you like that.

45
00:03:37.333 --> 00:03:40.900
Ash, if something is bothering you, you can talk to me.

46
00:03:41.433 --> 00:03:43.800
I'll listen, anytime you want.

47
00:03:45.366 --> 00:03:48.233
Seriously. Anytime, anywhere.

48
00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:54.833
I know how you feel. I've been there.

49
00:03:57.433 --> 00:03:59.766
Remember when I really goofed at the--?

50
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:02.333
You don't have a clue how I feel!

51
00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:09.033
Then tell me about it!

52
00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.800
It's none of your business! Leave me alone!

53
00:04:18.466 --> 00:04:21.300
- Huh?
- The Ash I know is full of energy.

54
00:04:21.366 --> 00:04:23.700
He's a leader. Always tries his best.

55
00:04:23.766 --> 00:04:25.533
He's always positive.

56
00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.000
And he never gives up.

57
00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:29.466
He hangs in there till the very end.

58
00:04:29.966 --> 00:04:32.833
You're not acting like the Ash I know!

59
00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.466
-Stop!

60
00:04:35.133 --> 00:04:37.066
Give me back the real Ash!

61
00:04:37.133 --> 00:04:39.600
Because you sure aren't him!

62
00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.500
Real Ash?

63
00:04:47.966 --> 00:04:49.066
Whoa.

64
00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.100
Oh, man!

65
00:05:08.633 --> 00:05:10.100
I've had enough of this!

66
00:05:10.166 --> 00:05:13.266
I'm overthinking it. It's making my head hurt.

67
00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:15.366
I've gotta get myself in gear.

68
00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.366
If there's something I don't understand, all I've gotta do is get moving.

69
00:05:20.433 --> 00:05:21.633
I'll figure it out.

70
00:05:38.566 --> 00:05:41.866
- Bidoof? Bidoof!
- Huh?

71
00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.833
That was close.

72
00:05:49.866 --> 00:05:52.433
-Huh?

73
00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.566
Pi, Pika!

74
00:06:00.466 --> 00:06:03.933
Talonflame!

75
00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.933
Now Serena disappeared, too.

76
00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.166
This is no fun.

77
00:06:07.366 --> 00:06:10.166
I'm sure they'll both be back soon. Look!

78
00:06:10.733 --> 00:06:13.166
- See? I told you!
- Lucha?

79
00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.566
Serena, where have you been?

80
00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.533
Drop it!

81
00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:22.666
Hmph!

82
00:06:24.266 --> 00:06:25.933
Think something happened?

83
00:06:26.333 --> 00:06:27.466
Hm.

84
00:06:29.533 --> 00:06:31.666
Oh. It's snowing.

85
00:06:33.666 --> 00:06:35.500
Everyone, please come in.

86
00:06:35.733 --> 00:06:37.800
The snow is supposed to get heavy.

87
00:06:37.866 --> 00:06:38.866
Oh, okay.

88
00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:41.766
Pika, Pi. Pika!

89
00:06:41.833 --> 00:06:43.033
Who cares?

90
00:06:43.266 --> 00:06:44.433
Pika!

91
00:06:47.066 --> 00:06:50.133
All right! All right! I know! I know! Ugh!

92
00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:53.933
Serena, something wrong?

93
00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:58.833
I'm going to drag Ash back before the weather gets worse. It's dangerous!

94
00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:00.733
- I'm going, too.
- Pikachu!

95
00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.400
- Hawlucha.
- Noivern.

96
00:07:02.466 --> 00:07:04.333
I've gotta get my backpack.

97
00:07:09.866 --> 00:07:11.833
Sorry about today, Greninja.

98
00:07:13.033 --> 00:07:15.166
If I had just been stronger...

99
00:07:16.066 --> 00:07:18.500
I should've been able to draw out your true power.

100
00:07:19.666 --> 00:07:21.266
If only I was stronger...

101
00:07:23.566 --> 00:07:27.033
Greninja!

102
00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.033
I should be fine here.

103
00:07:39.733 --> 00:07:40.933
What a storm.

104
00:07:47.633 --> 00:07:49.066
Pika, Pi!

105
00:07:49.733 --> 00:07:50.733
Pika.

106
00:07:51.166 --> 00:07:55.533
- Ash, where are you?!
- Ash, please! Answer us!

107
00:07:57.766 --> 00:08:00.700
He was right around here before.

108
00:08:01.966 --> 00:08:03.300
Lux...

109
00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:08.800
Luxray, can you see Ash?

110
00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.366
Luxray.

111
00:08:12.866 --> 00:08:14.033
Hey, Ash!

112
00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:15.766
Can't see a thing!

113
00:08:15.833 --> 00:08:16.733
Dedenne.

114
00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:19.900
So...

115
00:08:22.133 --> 00:08:24.666
Well, well, all alone, eh?

116
00:08:24.733 --> 00:08:27.266
No finer Pikachu than a twerpless one.

117
00:08:27.333 --> 00:08:28.800
I call interception.

118
00:08:28.866 --> 00:08:30.333
Wobbuffet!

119
00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:31.633
Pika!

120
00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:33.400
No, not that old trick.

121
00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:35.799
Chu!

122
00:08:37.866 --> 00:08:39.000
Pi? Pika?

123
00:08:39.533 --> 00:08:41.566
- Did you feel that?
- Hardly.

124
00:08:41.833 --> 00:08:43.700
It tickled me a little bit.

125
00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:46.233
See, it usually hurts here.

126
00:08:47.533 --> 00:08:49.533
Come on, give us your best shot.

127
00:08:50.233 --> 00:08:51.833
Chu!

128
00:08:54.733 --> 00:08:55.933
Best?

129
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.800
Zap us like you mean it, kid.

130
00:08:57.866 --> 00:08:58.933
Pika?

131
00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.533
- I think your battery needs recharging.
- Wobbuffet!

132
00:09:02.933 --> 00:09:03.833
Pika.

133
00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:08.233
Pikachu!

134
00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:11.566
We and our big mouths!

135
00:09:11.633 --> 00:09:13.333
No blastoff?

136
00:09:14.966 --> 00:09:18.033
- Your thunderbolt stinks.
- Pika.

137
00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:19.533
Why the lack of pep?

138
00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.533
No twerp may mean no zap.

139
00:09:21.966 --> 00:09:25.466
I'd say catching a weak Pikachu hardly seems worth the bother.

140
00:09:25.533 --> 00:09:26.966
- Hm.
- I agree.

141
00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:29.166
Think of the zapping we'd get from the boss.

142
00:09:29.233 --> 00:09:31.033
- Wobbuffet...
- Let's go home.

143
00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.966
- Where the heart is.
- Pika?!

144
00:09:35.066 --> 00:09:36.833
- Pikachu!

145
00:09:38.466 --> 00:09:40.066
Pikachu, what's wrong?

146
00:09:40.366 --> 00:09:41.400
Pika...

147
00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:46.033
We need to find Ash before it gets any worse.

148
00:09:47.966 --> 00:09:48.966
Ash...

149
00:09:52.566 --> 00:09:54.666
Who's that Pokémon?

150
00:09:59.033 --> 00:10:00.566
It's Oddish!

151
00:10:00.633 --> 00:10:01.800
Oddish!

152
00:10:06.266 --> 00:10:07.333
Clemont?

153
00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:09.000
Bonnie, are you all right?

154
00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.566
I'm wobbly.

155
00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:11.933
Hm?

156
00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:23.866
Wait! Squishy?

157
00:10:23.933 --> 00:10:24.800
Pika!

158
00:10:32.533 --> 00:10:33.933
Look, Clemont.

159
00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.033
Squishy found a safe place.

160
00:10:36.266 --> 00:10:39.000
- We should take a break for now.
- Okay.

161
00:10:42.633 --> 00:10:45.466
Oh, Ash, I hope you're all right.

162
00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:47.800
Don't worry. It's okay.

163
00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:50.466
Thanks. But I let something he said get to me,

164
00:10:50.533 --> 00:10:53.466
and I said something really terrible back to him.

165
00:10:54.133 --> 00:10:55.033
It's just...

166
00:10:55.466 --> 00:10:59.300
It's just that I admire Ash so much.

167
00:10:59.366 --> 00:11:02.200
Me, too. Ash is one of a kind.

168
00:11:02.266 --> 00:11:03.366
Pika, Pika.

169
00:11:03.833 --> 00:11:07.633
We'll get back to looking for him as soon as the storm lets up.

170
00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.466
Huh?

171
00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.766
Hey, I won't hurt you. Come here.

172
00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.800
See? It's okay!

173
00:11:22.866 --> 00:11:23.700
Huh?

174
00:11:28.766 --> 00:11:30.966
You see? It's okay, everyone.

175
00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.933
Huh?

176
00:11:39.633 --> 00:11:42.533
You'll be warmer in here. Let's stay together.

177
00:11:44.033 --> 00:11:45.600
That's it. Come in.

178
00:11:46.266 --> 00:11:48.900
See that? I told you it'd be warmer.

179
00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.400
Pika?

180
00:12:06.833 --> 00:12:09.400
-Huh?

181
00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:14.900
Ah!

182
00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.366
Ah! Spewpa!

183
00:12:20.066 --> 00:12:22.033
Okay, everybody stay right here.

184
00:12:46.133 --> 00:12:47.300
Ninja.

185
00:12:50.766 --> 00:12:53.366
Okay, one more to go. Hang in there.

186
00:13:03.033 --> 00:13:04.100
Over here.

187
00:13:05.733 --> 00:13:08.900
Sure. You can do it. Just be strong.

188
00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:17.300
Come with me, please. Get back with your friends.

189
00:13:20.666 --> 00:13:22.700
All right! You're awesome.

190
00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:32.100
Huh?

191
00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:35.866
Ninja!

192
00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:37.233
Greninja!

193
00:13:39.866 --> 00:13:41.000
Spewpa!

194
00:13:46.166 --> 00:13:47.733
Spewpa's in trouble.

195
00:13:54.766 --> 00:13:57.266
But the two of us can fix that together.

196
00:13:59.333 --> 00:14:01.933
Ninja!

197
00:14:07.433 --> 00:14:09.000
Let's do it!

198
00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.833
Dodge that branch. Go right.

199
00:14:22.633 --> 00:14:24.333
Another one. Dodge it.

200
00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.433
All right, slow down.

201
00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:32.333
There.

202
00:14:39.766 --> 00:14:41.000
We did it!

203
00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.700
Don't worry, Spewpa, you're safe now.

204
00:14:52.133 --> 00:14:52.966
Greninja.

205
00:14:53.866 --> 00:14:55.566
Thanks so much.

206
00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.066
Ninja.

207
00:14:57.966 --> 00:15:00.133
Sorry I worried you.

208
00:15:00.566 --> 00:15:02.633
Greninja.

209
00:15:07.366 --> 00:15:10.100
You know what? This happened once before.

210
00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:13.166
-When I was just a kid...

211
00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.600
I always wanna meet new Pokémon,

212
00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:19.800
so, one time, I went into the forest alone and got lost.

213
00:15:22.833 --> 00:15:27.400
I brought some Pokémon in out of the rain with me, just like what we're doing now.

214
00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.533
I was so happy.

215
00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:32.766
I thought about how much I wanted to become a trainer,

216
00:15:32.833 --> 00:15:35.300
so I could travel around with my Pokémon.

217
00:15:36.266 --> 00:15:38.066
I'm sorry, Greninja.

218
00:15:38.133 --> 00:15:41.366
I know that I promised we'd become stronger together.

219
00:15:41.766 --> 00:15:43.233
I realized it when I was alone.

220
00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:45.400
After I told Sawyer I'd win my eighth badge,

221
00:15:45.466 --> 00:15:48.933
I wanted it so bad, I had to beat Wulfric, no matter what.

222
00:15:49.366 --> 00:15:53.600
I got impatient. I thought I'd have to do it all 'cause I'm the trainer.

223
00:15:53.666 --> 00:15:55.000
That's not teamwork.

224
00:15:55.433 --> 00:15:58.833
Teamwork is when a team becomes strong together.

225
00:15:59.233 --> 00:16:01.633
My friends are right here next to me.

226
00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.533
Friends I really care about.

227
00:16:03.866 --> 00:16:08.966
Spewpa, I was totally determined to help you out, too, no matter what.

228
00:16:09.033 --> 00:16:12.233
But I was able to do it because Greninja was with me.

229
00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.500
Please, Greninja. Lend me your strength.

230
00:16:19.866 --> 00:16:22.433
Let's start from zero again.

231
00:16:23.633 --> 00:16:24.766
As a team.

232
00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:27.766
Ninja.

233
00:16:34.066 --> 00:16:35.900
You're all gonna be okay now.

234
00:16:44.366 --> 00:16:46.333
- Wow.
- Ninja.

235
00:17:07.066 --> 00:17:08.166
The snow stopped.

236
00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.733
I hope Ash is all right.

237
00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.733
Pika?

238
00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:18.966
What is that?

239
00:17:25.966 --> 00:17:26.966
Hey, guys.

240
00:17:27.833 --> 00:17:29.133
Pika, Pi!

241
00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.900
Pikachu! I'm sorry if I made you worry.

242
00:17:33.966 --> 00:17:36.466
Hey! We've been looking for you.

243
00:17:36.533 --> 00:17:38.033
I'm glad you're okay.

244
00:17:38.366 --> 00:17:40.666
I'm sorry, everyone.

245
00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.133
- Uh, Ash...
- Thanks, Serena.

246
00:17:44.466 --> 00:17:47.666
- Huh?
- What you said made me snap out of it.

247
00:17:50.566 --> 00:17:52.500
I'm glad. Welcome back.

248
00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.300
-Dedenne.

249
00:17:56.166 --> 00:17:57.400
Can you hear me?

250
00:17:57.933 --> 00:18:01.500
Ash and Greninja thought of each other even while they apart.

251
00:18:01.566 --> 00:18:05.833
They combined their strength, and the bond between them is stronger.

252
00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:09.466
I think this world, full of people and Pokémon...

253
00:18:09.766 --> 00:18:12.333
Is it possible that's something we can believe in?

254
00:18:16.833 --> 00:18:17.833
Huh?

255
00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.466
Ninja!

256
00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.000
Salutations.

257
00:18:26.766 --> 00:18:27.766
Team Rocket?!

258
00:18:27.833 --> 00:18:30.266
We've been waiting patiently for you to come back.

259
00:18:30.333 --> 00:18:32.500
Pikachu, I'll bet you're ecstatic.

260
00:18:32.566 --> 00:18:34.400
And primed for picking.

261
00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:37.200
Pi. Pika, Pika.

262
00:18:37.633 --> 00:18:38.666
- Huh?
- Ooh.

263
00:18:38.733 --> 00:18:40.766
We are feeling better, aren't we?

264
00:18:40.833 --> 00:18:42.900
That's the spirit we adore.

265
00:18:42.966 --> 00:18:45.000
Gourgeist, use dark pulse.

266
00:18:45.066 --> 00:18:47.466
Inkay, you use psybeam.

267
00:18:50.966 --> 00:18:52.933
Pikachu, thunderbolt, let's go.

268
00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.500
Pikachu!

269
00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.766
There it is. Just like old times.

270
00:19:03.833 --> 00:19:05.466
The power that refreshes.

271
00:19:05.533 --> 00:19:07.100
And it's worth the wait.

272
00:19:08.633 --> 00:19:11.066
Refreshing. A zap for the history books.

273
00:19:11.133 --> 00:19:14.366
Which means, time to get our eyes back on the Pikachu prize.

274
00:19:14.433 --> 00:19:15.800
Worthy and wise.

275
00:19:15.866 --> 00:19:17.866
So, it's back to plan A.

276
00:19:17.933 --> 00:19:19.066
Wobbuffet.

277
00:19:19.133 --> 00:19:22.000
We're blasting off again, but having a nice day.

278
00:19:22.066 --> 00:19:23.400
- Wobbuffet.
- Gourgeist.

279
00:19:23.466 --> 00:19:24.666
Inkay.

280
00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:28.966
Look, everybody.

281
00:19:29.033 --> 00:19:31.466
Lumiose City's on TV.

282
00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.900
- Wow. Wonder why.
- It has been decided

283
00:19:34.966 --> 00:19:38.700
that the next Kalos League will take place in Lumiose City.

284
00:19:38.766 --> 00:19:41.100
Yeah! Lumiose City, huh?

285
00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:44.333
All the exciting preparations are currently underway.

286
00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:47.433
Which means, it's sure to be as stupendous as ever.

287
00:19:47.866 --> 00:19:50.533
- Pika, Pika.
- I know. We're there.

288
00:19:50.733 --> 00:19:52.433
What do you say, Greninja?

289
00:19:52.633 --> 00:19:54.800
- Let's really show them.
- Ninja!

290
00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.700
Greninja, what's wrong?

291
00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:02.800
Huh?

292
00:20:07.466 --> 00:20:08.466
Grenin.

293
00:20:22.233 --> 00:20:23.366
Mmm.

294
00:20:25.266 --> 00:20:26.466
I get it, Greninja.

295
00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:28.800
I won't lose my way again.

296
00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.833
We will get to the league.

297
00:20:31.266 --> 00:20:33.466
But first, the Snowbelle Gym.

298
00:20:33.533 --> 00:20:34.833
Ninja!

299
00:20:39.733 --> 00:20:41.700
It looks as if the Snowbelle Gym

300
00:20:41.766 --> 00:20:44.000
is about to have some repeat visitors,

301
00:20:44.066 --> 00:20:46.433
as the journey continues.
